 file section.                                                                         file control. 
 fd emp-file.                                                                               select emp-file assign to disk1.
    01 emp-rec.                                                                             organization is sequential.
       02 emp-id   pic  9(02).                                                              access mode is sequential.
       02 filler   pic  x(01).                                                              file status is fs.
       02 emp-name pic  a(10).                                                          data division.  
       02 filler   pic  x(27).                                                          file section.
working-storage section.                                                                fd emp-file.
01  fs  pic  9(02).                                                                        01  emp-rec.
01  sub pic  9(02).                                                                          02  emp-id   pic  9(02).
procedure division.                                                                          02  filler   pic  x(01).  
     perfrom  open-para.                                                                     02  emp-name pic  x(10).
     perfrom  write-para varying sub 1 by 1 until sub > 5.                                   02  filler   pic  x(27).
     perfrom  close-para.                                                                working-storage section.
   open-para.                                                                            01   fs    pic  9(02).
       open output emp-file.                                                             01   sub   pic  9(02).
       display 'file open status: ' fs                                                   procedure division.
    write-para.                                                                               perform open-para.      
        accept emp-id.                                                                        perform write-para varying sub from 1 by 1 until sub > 5.
        accept emp-name.                                                                      perform close-para.
        write emp-rec.                                                                       open-para. 
        display emp-id ',' emp-name                                                              open output emp-file
        display 'file write status: ' fs                                                         display 'file status code: ' fs
     close-para.                                                                              write-para
        close emp-file.                                                                            accept emp-id.
        display 'file close status: ' fs.                                                          accept emp-name.
