data division.                                                                                file control    
file section.                                                                                     organization is sequential.
fd emp-file.                                                                                      access mode is sequential.
   01 emp-rec.                                                                                    file status is fs.
      02 emp-id   pic 9(02).                                                                   data division.
      02 filler   pic x(01).                                                                   file section.
      02 emp-name pic 9(04).                                                                   fd emp-file. 
      02 filler   pic x(27).                                                                      01  emp-rec.
working-storage section.                                                                          02  emp-id   pic  9(02).  
01 fs  pic 9(02).                                                                                 02  filler   pic  x(01).
01 sub pic 9(02).                                                                                 02  emp-name pic  x(10).
procedure division.                                                                               02  filler   pic  x(27).
    perfrom open-para.                                                                         procedure division.
    perfrom read-para varying  from 1 by 1 until sub > 5.                                             perform  open-para.  
    perfrom close-para.                                                                               perform  read-para varying sub from 1 by 1 until sub >5.
    open-para                                                                                         perform  close-para.
       open input emp-file                                                                            open-para
       display 'file open status code: ' fs.                                                              open input emp-file
    read-para                                                                                             display 'file status code: ' fs     
        read emp-file                                                                                 read-para 
            at end                                                                                         read emp-file
               dispaly 'completed'                                                                            at end
            not at end                                                                                           display 'completed'  
                display 'file status code: '                                                                  not at end
         end-read.                                                                                                display  emp-id  ',' emp-name
    close-para.                                                                                             end-read 
       close emp-file                                                                                  close-para
       display 'file status code: '.                                                                       close  emp-file
